{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","title":"Presenting from a link","roleHeading":"Article"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting from a link","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the Verifier’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before anything is shown."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it returns says:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"who is asking: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", its name, and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when a registrar the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet trusts ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") registered it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each with the held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials that can answer it, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Present","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Present"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation: Presentation","    do {","        presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    } catch let error as WalletError where error.code == .requestRefused {","        \/\/ A refused request: the Verifier was told, and may say where to","        \/\/ take the holder next (OpenID4VP §8.2).","        return wallet.takeRefusalRedirect()","    }","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection: Presentation.Selection","    let disclosures: [Presentation.Disclosure]","    do {","        selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","        disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    } catch {","        \/\/ Nothing can be shown: decline, so the Verifier isn't left waiting.","        _ = try? await presentation.decline()","        throw error","    }","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" picks the first credential that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each query’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead: a query that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selection, after checking it answers the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says what it would disclose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"agrees."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", when the Verifier sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page. The library refuses http and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schemes that run code or read local data, but lets through a scheme the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier’s own app may have registered: open an https URL in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"browser, any other only through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication.open"},{"type":"text","text":", never in a web"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, and never one in the wallet’s own schemes ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":", its redirect URI’s), which would start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another flow in the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"When-the-wallet-refuses-a-request","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"When the wallet refuses a request"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A request the wallet must not answer — one with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transaction_data"},{"type":"text","text":" it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t support, or a parameter OpenID4VP forbids — makes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" throw"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/requestRefused","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/protocolError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the error code the wallet sent the Verifier, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_transaction_data"},{"type":"text","text":". Nothing is shown to the holder, and nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is presented. The Verifier may answer the refusal with a redirect:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/takeRefusalRedirect()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns it, once, and you open it in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the browser the request came from, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so the holder isn’t left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stranded. Tell the holder the request wasn’t answered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists the claims it asks for beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it’s registered to request, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it names no claims at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all. The library flags such a query in full, though OpenID4VP 1.0"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"§6.4.1 reads it as asking for no selectively disclosable claims, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation for it discloses only what the credential always shows."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is refused for them: show them, and let the holder decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Keep-presentations-unlinkable","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Keep presentations unlinkable"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each presentation uses a copy of the credential, bound to its own key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so two Verifiers can’t link the holder’s presentations by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" chooses which copy:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perPresentation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the default: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copy no Verifier has seen, every time."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": the copy a Verifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has seen before, so it can recognize a returning holder, and an unused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one for a new Verifier."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once every copy is used, one is reused. A candidate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether presenting it now would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand this Verifier a copy another has seen: warn the holder, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh the credential ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") when its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reaches zero."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"When-delivery-is-uncertain","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"When delivery is uncertain"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If sending the response fails in a way that leaves it unknown whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Verifier received it, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/deliveryUnknown","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and doesn’t send it again: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder should check with the Verifier before sharing again."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/preview(selection:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/preview(selection:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What responding with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selection"},{"type":"text","text":" would disclose, without signing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or sending anything."}],"title":"preview(selection:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preview","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"selection","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Selection","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC9Selectiona"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Disclosure","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC10DisclosureV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/takeRefusalRedirect()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/takerefusalredirect()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the Verifier asked to take the holder after the wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refused its request: when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startPresentation"},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestRefused"},{"type":"text","text":", open this URL, if any, as OpenID4VP §8.2 has a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet do. It’s returned once."}],"title":"takeRefusalRedirect()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"takeRefusalRedirect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/takeRefusalRedirect()","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/verifierRoots":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/verifierroots","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PEM certificates: the trust anchors for Verifiers’ requests. A request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed by a certificate that doesn’t chain to them is refused unread."}],"title":"verifierRoots","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifierRoots","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/defaultSelection()":{"title":"defaultSelection()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSelection"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Selection","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC9Selectiona"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/defaultselection()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The selection the wallet would make itself, for an app with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"policy of its own, or to start from: the first answerable option"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of each credential set, and each query’s first credential, even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it takes several: the holder adds the others. Throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noMatchingCredential"},{"type":"text","text":" when the request can’t be answered."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/invalidInput":{"title":"invalidInput","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidInput"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/invalidinput","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidInput","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An argument, a link or the configuration is malformed."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/verifier-swift.property":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/verifier-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Who is asking."}],"title":"verifier","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Verifier","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC8VerifierV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/registrarRoots":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/registrarroots","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PEM certificates: the registrars whose registrations of Verifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the wallet checks ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Presentation.Verifier.registration"},{"type":"text","text":"). Empty:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registrations are ignored."}],"title":"registrarRoots","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registrarRoots"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/copiesLeft":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/copiesleft","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many copies no Verifier has seen."}],"title":"copiesLeft","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copiesLeft","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/copyPolicy-swift.property":{"title":"copyPolicy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"copyPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet19WalletConfigurationV10CopyPolicyO","text":"CopyPolicy"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/copypolicy-swift.property","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Which copy of a credential a presentation uses."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Query/unregisteredAll":{"title":"unregisteredAll","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unregisteredAll"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/query\/unregisteredall","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether it names no claims, beyond a verified registration. Such a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"query is flagged in full, though OpenID4VP 1.0 §6.4.1 reads it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking for no selectively disclosable claims."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/RequestLink":{"title":"RequestLink","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RequestLink"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/requestlink","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RequestLink"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An OpenID4VP request link’s parts."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/invalidSelection":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/invalidselection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A presentation’s selection doesn’t answer the request as it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks: an unknown query or credential, one that doesn’t answer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its query, more than one for a query that takes one, or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"required credential set left unanswered."}],"title":"invalidSelection","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidSelection"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Selection":{"title":"Presentation.Selection","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Selection"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/selection","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Selection"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What